# Blinn-Phong material with the metal plate textures (without the normal map, see square_normal_map.mtl).
# The diffuse, ambient and specular colors are multiplied by the textures, the shininess Ns by the red channel
# of map_Ns.
# A painted, rusted plate is rough, so Ns is small, and it is not a metal, so it reflects only a few percent of the
# light specularly (about 4%), hence Ks well below one: 0.22 in sRGB is 0.04 in linear space.
newmtl MetalPlate
Ka 1.0 1.0 1.0
Kd 1.0 1.0 1.0
Ks 0.22 0.22 0.22
Ns 100.0
map_Kd metal_plate/textures/metal_plate_diff_1k.png
map_Ka metal_plate/textures/metal_plate_diff_1k.png
map_Ks metal_plate/textures/metal_plate_spec_1k.png
map_Ns metal_plate/textures/ns0001.png
illum 2
